# Firebase deploy on main

When changes are pushed to the `main` branch, Firebase Hosting must be deployed.

## CI (automatic)

GitHub Actions workflow `.github/workflows/deploy-firebase.yml` runs `npm run deploy` on every push to `main`.

Required repo secret: `FIREBASE_TOKEN` (generate with `firebase login:ci`).

## Manual deploy

```bash
cd frontend
npm run deploy
```

## After frontend changes

If you commit and push to `main`, confirm the GitHub Actions deploy workflow succeeds unless the user asked for a local-only change.
